'''Blessed Business''' (商売繁盛祈願, ''Shōbai Hanjō Kigan'', '''Pray for Business Prosperity''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Worker Cat Max UP (M): Wallet size is increased by 20%.

